       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-WEYL-SKYRMION-ALGEBRA-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-WEYL-CLOSURE-STATE.
           05  WS-COMMUTATION-REL-MET      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHASE-SPACE-WINDING-Q    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WEYL-ALGEBRA-A1-CLOSED   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PURE-SYNAPSE-MAP-VALID   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLOSURE-PROOF-FLAGS.
           05  WS-ALGEBRAIC-EXACT-MET      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-WEYL-PROOF-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-WEYL-COMMUTATION.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-TOPOLOGICAL-MAPPING.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-WEYL-COMMUTATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COMMUTATION-REL-MET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WEYL-ALGEBRA-A1-CLOSED.
       2000-VERIFY-TOPOLOGICAL-MAPPING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PHASE-SPACE-WINDING-Q.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PURE-SYNAPSE-MAP-VALID.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           IF WS-COMMUTATION-REL-MET = 1 AND
              WS-WEYL-ALGEBRA-A1-CLOSED = 1 AND
              WS-PHASE-SPACE-WINDING-Q = 1 AND
              WS-PURE-SYNAPSE-MAP-VALID = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-WEYL-PROOF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-WEYL-PROOF-CODE.
